                          <br />
                          <span>Maximum ambient temperature: 40 °C</span>
                          <br />
                          <span>Maximum operating pressure: 16 bar</span>
                          <br />
                          <span>Pipe connection standard: EN 1092-2</span>
                          <br />
                          <span>Type of inlet connection: DIN</span>
                          <br />
